": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210393_852485259855759_6019629505745872437_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3tA14_JZL08Q7kNvwEgWP11&_nc_oc=AdpcHFou_biSx1USlFQX_j6IPujYyT8BAE1FcDdFWgcxuFi1E_LNvGDaMRWoV7fKiVg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL9WstgzVrshQgU9V_0Bq34BHkpPTRneDDMM6TmyCNZlg&oe=6ABE851B"}, {"file_name": "sc1.png", "id": "1698965373936946", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982551_1698965377270279_7553645442698234559_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jwCf9C56CE4Q7kNvwGkGwra&_nc_oc=Ado3VBA3SHxP9B_yDz4q1dusjGn7TvmeDUWkv4jlnlUMK9A2QuflT-6v0NeH0TbTvsg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIBSM3EpKXSE9tvWSfhKtwWqMw0eBdlumYJ47nEofT3gA&oe=6ABE7561"}, {"file_name": "sc3.png", "id": "362227642863079", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_362227646196412_4627867009706605201_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=c-Nte7SaRCIQ7kNvwFow_iy&_nc_oc=Adp9TwtWC0CxKkpgDf3xWpLWgGEhnK3o5BnqRzoPSp7CbzZDVcKNuK4bUy51JQojPRs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIRni4CQhFKlojB0aMe8XcAtk28Q-1UJOkp7JRPycNS4A&oe=6ABE622F"}, {"file_name": "sc5.png", "id": "167386486400512", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982562_167386489733845_2832025039911865533_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ke64fQU4qKwQ7kNvwHsycSp&_nc_oc=AdolkhyAUXD_2TyabH4bKQ696ZEJa2DWJxRkECLgvv1GOFUnVbEDRAeL3pRfvvDb7R8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJXIJVbgyhTUs8vPUY9jVCyuxt_6yF1w-wtjnxHmiQb4w&oe=6ABE61D2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "sc4.png", "id": "860094495571873", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240101_860094502238539_6759068810652291731_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QMqwecDDbOsQ7kNvwHFs8XD&_nc_oc=AdpfoH7qFQGthb_zfN9ovXMM_0DcCUA6niByHFAtEOBh3Od6iaQI_Vo1gElWEsjIVUA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIzJ8axqGBJS_4DHgjUW8ayamBn5GgYLqCVJnCkIlw5dQ&oe=6ABE6B7D"}, "display_name": "Ball smasher", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. \n\nWhether you prefer the satisfying thud of a baseball bat connecting with a ball or the raw power of using your fists, the ball smasher offers a unique and cathartic way to let off steam. \n\nIt transforms the act of stress relief into a physical and engaging activity. So, the next time stress looms, head to the ball smasher and unleash your frustration on those unsuspecting balls. It's not just a stress reliever; it's a fun and dynamic approach to coping with life's pressures, promoting a healthier and more balanced mindset. \n\nTake a swing, make a hit, and feel the tension melt away as you engage in this unconventional yet effective stress-busting activity.", "short_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisoft.pl/policies/bs_v1.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisoft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bs.a